const body = $input.item.json.body || $input.item.json || {};
let entry = (body.entry && body.entry[0]) ? body.entry[0] : {};
let changes = (entry.changes && entry.changes[0]) ? entry.changes[0] : {};
let value = changes.value || body.value || {};
let metadata = value.metadata || body.metadata || {};
let messages = (value.messages && value.messages[0]) ? value.messages[0] : (body.messages && body.messages[0] ? body.messages[0] : {});
let contacts = (value.contacts && value.contacts[0]) ? value.contacts[0] : (body.contacts && body.contacts[0] ? body.contacts[0] : {});

const phone_number_id = metadata.phone_number_id || body.phone_number_id || '10023456789';
let sender_number   = messages.from || body.number || body.from || '';
let message_text    = '';
let button_id       = '';

if (messages.interactive && messages.interactive.button_reply) {
  button_id = messages.interactive.button_reply.id || '';
  message_text = button_id || messages.interactive.button_reply.title || '';
} else if (messages.interactive && messages.interactive.list_reply) {
  button_id = messages.interactive.list_reply.id || '';
  message_text = button_id || messages.interactive.list_reply.title || '';
} else if (messages.type === 'button' && messages.button) {
  button_id = messages.button.payload || messages.button.text || '';
  message_text = button_id || messages.button.text || '';
} else if (messages.type === 'location' && messages.location) {
  const loc = messages.location;
  message_text = `UBICACION: ${loc.latitude},${loc.longitude} (${loc.name || loc.address || ''})`.trim();
} else if (messages.text && messages.text.body) {
  message_text = messages.text.body;
} else {
  message_text = body.message || body.text || '';
}

const contact_name = (contacts.profile && contacts.profile.name) ? contacts.profile.name : (body.name || 'Cliente');
let media_url = '';
if (messages.type === 'image' && messages.image) {
  media_url = messages.image.id || messages.image.link || 'https://example.com/comprobante.jpg';
} else {
  media_url = body.media_url || '';
}

return {
  phone_number_id,
  sender_number: (sender_number || '').trim(),
  message_text: (message_text || '').trim(),
  button_id: button_id || '',
  contact_name,
  media_url,
  timestamp: messages.timestamp || Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000)
};

const tenant = $input.first() ? $input.first().json : null;
const meta = $('Code - Extraer Datos Meta Payload').item.json;

if (!tenant || !tenant.id) {
  return {
    found: false,
    message: '⛔ Este número de WhatsApp Business no está registrado en el sistema.',
    sender_number: meta.sender_number
  };
}

const isBusiness = (meta.sender_number === tenant.number);
return {
  found: true,
  tenant: {
    id: tenant.id,
    name: tenant.name,
    number: tenant.number,
    whatsapp_phone_number_id: tenant.whatsapp_phone_number_id,
    whatsapp_access_token: tenant.whatsapp_access_token,
    require_delivery_address: tenant.require_delivery_address !== false,
    enable_sales: tenant.enable_sales !== false,
    enable_crud: tenant.enable_crud !== false,
    enable_reports: tenant.enable_reports !== false,
    enable_appointments: tenant.enable_appointments !== false
  },
  sender: {
    type: isBusiness ? 'business' : 'client',
    number: meta.sender_number,
    name: isBusiness ? tenant.name : meta.contact_name
  },
  message: {
    text: meta.message_text,
    button_id: meta.button_id || '',
    media_url: meta.media_url,
    timestamp: meta.timestamp
  }
};

const upsertRes = $input.first() ? $input.first().json : {};
const ctx = $('Code - Evaluar Rol Negocio o Cliente').item.json;

return {
  tenant: ctx.tenant,
  sender: {
    ...ctx.sender,
    client_id: upsertRes.id || ctx.sender.client_id
  },
  message: ctx.message
};

const rawOutput = $input.item.json.output || $input.item.json.text || '{}';
const ctx = $('Code - Evaluar Rol Negocio o Cliente').item.json;
let subflow = ctx.sender.type === 'business' ? 'help_menu' : 'sales';

try {
  const jsonMatch = rawOutput.match(/\{[\s\S]*\}/);
  if (jsonMatch) {
    const parsed = JSON.parse(jsonMatch[0]);
    if (parsed.subflow) subflow = parsed.subflow;
  }
} catch(e) {
  // fallback
}

// Verificar permisos del negocio para la herramienta seleccionada
const t = ctx.tenant;
if (subflow === 'sales' && !t.enable_sales) subflow = 'disabled';
if (subflow === 'crud' && !t.enable_crud) subflow = 'disabled';
if (subflow === 'reports' && !t.enable_reports) subflow = 'disabled';
if (subflow === 'appointments' && !t.enable_appointments) subflow = 'disabled';

return {
  ...ctx,
  subflow
};

const ctx = $input.item.json;
const t = ctx.tenant;
const menu = `🛠️ *MENÚ DE HERRAMIENTAS DEL NEGOCIO*\n🏢 *${t.name}*\n\n` +
`Tus herramientas activas:\n` +
(t.enable_sales ? `✅ *Ventas y Despachos*: Pagos 1-clic, pedidos y envíos\n` : '') +
(t.enable_crud ? `✅ *Catálogo*: Inventario, precios y stock\n` : '') +
(t.enable_appointments ? `✅ *Citas*: Agenda comercial\n` : '') +
(t.enable_reports ? `✅ *Reportes*: Balance de ventas\n` : '') +
`\n👇 _Selecciona una acción rápida o escribe tu consulta:_`;

const buttons = [
  { id: "tareas", title: "📋 Ver Tareas" },
  { id: "despachos", title: "🚚 Ver Despachos" },
  { id: "ver inventario", title: "📦 Ver Inventario" }
];

return {
  wa_number: t.number,
  wa_message: menu,
  buttons: buttons,
  phone_number_id: t.whatsapp_phone_number_id,
  access_token: t.whatsapp_access_token
};
